Package: rktool
Type: Package
Title: Rhythmic Categories from Generic Event Sequences
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Lia", "Laffi", email = "lia.laffi01@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to compute rhythmic ratios (rk = tk / (tk + tk+1)) from
    onsets or inter-onset intervals of any sequence of events, classify them
    into the "on"/"off" bins of rhythmic categories (1_n, 1_1, n_1), count
    the bins per group, normalize the counts against a simulated null
    distribution of the intervals (or against the bin width), find the density
    peaks of rk, and test the significance of rhythmic categories across repeated
    normalizations.
